      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking i'd lean towards a dental abscess i think a dental X-ray makes sense here, for dental abscess you'll be taking amoxicillin, 500 milligrams, three times a day, five days that should help with dental abscess see the dentist today, rinse with warm salt water i'd like to see you again in two days"
